{'symbol': 'MCO', 'date': '2022-01-24 16:00:00', 'title': "DATES SET FOR MOODY'S EARNINGS RELEASE AND INVESTOR TELECONFERENCE", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MOODY'S CORPORATION (NYSE: MCO) WILL RELEASE ITS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2021 RESULTS BEFORE THE START OF NYSE TRADING ON THURSDAY, FEBRUARY 10, 2022. A COPY OF THE RELEASE WILL BE POSTED ON MOODY'S INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE, IR.MOODYS.COM. MOODY'S CORPORATION INVITES YOU TO PARTICIPATE IN A TELECONFERENCE ON THURSDAY, FEBRUARY 10, 2022 AT 11:30 A.M. EASTERN TIME TO DISCUSS ITS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2021 RESULTS. ROB FAUBER, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE"}